WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:04,400
Otherwise, take your team and join my base.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:12,220
My dog shook his head when he saw your conditions.

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,300
If there are good things, always stay close to yourself first

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,460
I'll show you around our urgent matters later.

5
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:22,390
Okay, how many teams will there be tomorrow?

6
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,590
Should be seven teams

7
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:26,100
Unless the granary is in Guangren River

8
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,700
It's just outside the main road, Sangshiduo.

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,780
Follow us and go deeper, the risk is not high

10
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:35,500
The most useless thing in Mo's family is money

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,140
My lord, yes
